      "auther_sha": "9810ef47bb3b541b520835ccd927d9334de553e1",
      "author": "slava77",
      "body": "following on suggestion from https://github.com/cms-sw/cmssw/issues/51245#issuecomment-5119259284 by @mmusich \r\n\r\nOverall, about a factor of 10 speedup from technical changes in `ExtendT5FromDupT5` kernel for the high-pt jets (2 TeV events) and some minor speedup in ttbar (this kernel itself was taking about 1/4 of the total LST processing time on CPU).\r\nSee details in the parent PR #51571\r\n\r\nThe 20_0_X backport is intended to:  \"allow faster HLT execution over samples produced in the Phase 2 MC production using the native release (in master, CMSSW_20_1_X this is already merged, but I think there might be people still using the native release).\"\r\n\r\n\r\n",
      "branch": "CMSSW_20_0_X",
